{"id":614,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自律と協働で未来を切り拓く県立中高一貫教育","feature_description":"佐世保北中学校は、県立の中高一貫教育の環境で、基礎学力と自ら学ぶ姿勢を大切にしています。教科の学びに加え、探究活動や学校行事を通して、課題を見つけて考え、仲間と協働して解決へ向かう力を育てます。中学から高校までの見通しを持った学習と進路指導を行い、地域や社会に関心を持ち、主体的に行動できる生徒の育成を目指します。未来につながる学びを進めます。","clubs":[{"id":15244,"name":"男子バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/bunrui/syoukai/jisseki/70060jisseki/304110.html","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15245,"name":"女子バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/bunrui/syoukai/jisseki/70060jisseki/304110.html","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15246,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/bunrui/syoukai/jisseki/70060jisseki/304110.html","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15247,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/bunrui/syoukai/jisseki/70060jisseki/304110.html","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15248,"name":"男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/bunrui/syoukai/jisseki/70060jisseki/304110.html","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15249,"name":"女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/bunrui/syoukai/jisseki/70060jisseki/304110.html","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15250,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/bunrui/syoukai/jisseki/70060jisseki/304110.html","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15251,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/bunrui/syoukai/jisseki/70060jisseki/304110.html","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15252,"name":"空手道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/bunrui/syoukai/jisseki/70060jisseki/304110.html","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15253,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www2.news.ed.jp/bunrui/syoukai/jisseki/70060jisseki/304110.html","verified_at":"2026-11-20"},{"id":15254,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www2.new